/// Huffman code built from a bool-tree model (`VP6_BuildHuffTree` 0x802a34ac / `ConvertBoolTrees` 0x8029fb3c):
/// leaf frequencies are the probabilities propagated down the tree (256 at the root, `count*p>>8`, zero -> 1), then
/// a Huffman tree is built over them (ascending count, ties by descending symbol, merged nodes placed before equal counts).
#[derive(Clone,Default)] struct Huff{nodes:Vec<(i64,i32,usize)>,root:usize}
